    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"stop the cycle of suffering\" and \"letting myself rest\"... that sounds almost peaceful when you put it like that. it's like, is it really so wrong to just want everything to be quiet and for them to finally be able to breathe again without worrying about me? it feels like the only way to actually be \"good\" to them is to not be there anymore.",
